></mxCell><mxCell id="nMVC" value="&lt;b&gt;Padrão MVC + DTO&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Visão (telas Swing) → Controller → Model (regras) → DAO (arquivo CSV).&lt;br&gt;As telas só conhecem DTO e controller. O DTO só transporta os dados, como texto, do jeito que foram digitados. O controller converte DTO ⇄ model e chama o DAO. O model valida e lança a mensagem de erro que a tela mostra." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#bfa94c;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1240" y="1400" width="500" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="N2" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;endSize=10;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.4;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="TM" target="MC"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="N3" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;endSize=10;exitX=0.1;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.85;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="TC" target="MC"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="N4" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;endSize=10;exitX=0.6;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.25;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="TC" target="CC"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="N5" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;endSize=10;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.8;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="TS" target="CC"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="N6" value="«usa»" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;endSize=10;dashed=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.03;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="GD" targe